  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose is to support African Union&apos;s initiative in validating the key climate change, peace, and security risk pathways identified in the Africa Climate Security Risk Assessment, and to gather further input to inform the development of a comprehensive Common African Position on Climate Peace and Security (CAP-CPS). Ireland provided support towards logistical expenses for African MS, RECs and other stakeholders,  personnel costs for Adelphi&#x2019;s conference management team and other associated administrative costs.This work involves adaptation to the political impact of climate change and mitigation of potential causes of conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
